{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">How To Get Involved Pre-Release</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wishlist, follow, and join our Discord for opportunities to play in early playtests and help craft the game. We would love to get a small core group of players who love the tower defense and bullet heaven genres so we can make a great game that fits your tastes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814360/extras/transtowermenu.gif?t=1749436622\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore the Campaign</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to the world of Valber! In TransmuTowers, you will explore Valber through a variety of maps, each with their own resources, challenges, and monsters to defeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814360/extras/unlockuniquetowers.gif?t=1749436622\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Fight New Enemies Each Level and Upgrade Yourself</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Establish a foothold on these maps, starting with a small camp and building up to a flourishing base where you can generate resources and build up your strength.  Our 20-30-min stage-based gameplay will allow you to try numerous base layouts and strategies, and reward you for it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814360/extras/upgradingmenu.gif?t=1749436622\" /></div> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Defend against the Hordes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each stage will feature new monsters to conquer, requiring the use of different strategies to beat the highest difficulties. Unlock new towers and effects rapidly as you play the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814360/extras/navyseal.gif?t=1749436622\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814360/extras/hyena.gif?t=1749436622\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Core Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defend multiple scenic locations throughout the campaign</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Roguelike Meta-progression for unlocking new strategies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Real-time strategic decision-making, No pre-defined monster paths here</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dozens of towers with hundreds of upgrades</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Randomized powerful augments each level to keep each game fresh</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ability to play solo or with friends</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2814360?t=1749436622","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814360/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749436622","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814360/b668099712985905284f0707ecb9ca69b3f11730/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749436622","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814360/b668099712985905284f0707ecb9ca69b3f11730/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749436622","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">How To Get Involved Pre-Release</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wishlist, follow, and join our Discord for opportunities to play in early playtests and help craft the game. We would love to get a small core group of players who love the tower defense and bullet heaven genres so we can make a great game that fits your tastes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814360/extras/transtowermenu.gif?t=1749436622\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore the Campaign</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to the world of Valber! In TransmuTowers, you will explore Valber through a variety of maps, each with their own resources, challenges, and monsters to defeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814360/extras/unlockuniquetowers.gif?t=1749436622\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Fight New Enemies Each Level and Upgrade Yourself</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Establish a foothold on these maps, starting with a small camp and building up to a flourishing base where you can generate resources and build up your strength.  Our 20-30-min stage-based gameplay will allow you to try numerous base layouts and strategies, and reward you for it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814360/extras/upgradingmenu.gif?t=1749436622\" /></div> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Defend against the Hordes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each stage will feature new monsters to conquer, requiring the use of different strategies to beat the highest difficulties. Unlock new towers and effects rapidly as you play the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814360/extras/navyseal.gif?t=1749436622\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img 